            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PortDeck 0.1.0-beta.16

- Adds keyboard navigation across provider tabs, including number-key shortcuts.
- Adds an in-app shortcut reference for discovering available keyboard controls.
- Keeps the menu-bar window usable on smaller displays by capping its height.
- Improves dense layouts with a compact footer and wrapped long Git branch names.
]]></description>
